                        "content": "Industry 4.0 represents the convergence of IT and OT (Operational Technology). It's no longer just software; it's cyber-physical systems.",
                        "translation": "La Industria 4.0 representa la convergencia de la TI y la TO (Tecnología Operativa). Ya no es solo software; son sistemas ciberfísicos.",
