                        "role": "Robert Hill",
                        "content": "I reviewed the Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) data. The spike is coming from upstream logistics. We had to switch to air freight because the maritime shipping lanes were disrupted.",
                        "translation": "Revisé los datos del Análisis de Ciclo de Vida (LCA). El pico proviene de la logística upstream. Tuvimos que cambiar a flete aéreo porque las rutas de envío marítimo estaban interrumpidas.",
